there is an argument in control.hazard, 'strata.name <http://strata.name>', which allow you
to replicate the log-baseline-hazard model, and I *think* this is doing
what you want.

Please check with simulated data from a known model and check that its
able to estimate the model back correctly.

Let me know..

H

